><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20251014093459+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20251014093533+10'00'" name="e1f75960-bb67-44c4-9a98-f474139ae505" page="10" coords="378.696000,709.668000,543.559000,709.668000,378.696000,698.879000,543.559000,698.879000,304.441000,697.763000,543.574000,697.763000,304.441000,686.974000,543.574000,686.974000,304.441000,685.801000,543.402000,685.801000,304.441000,675.011000,543.402000,675.011000,304.441000,673.839000,543.636000,673.839000,304.441000,663.049000,543.636000,663.049000,304.441000,661.877000,543.664000,661.877000,304.441000,651.087000,543.664000,651.087000,304.441000,649.915000,543.619000,649.915000,304.441000,639.125000,543.619000,639.125000,304.441000,637.952000,496.466000,637.952000,304.441000,627.163000,496.466000,627.163000" rect="304.103000,626.826000,544.001000,710.005000" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>In light&#xD;of the limited number of female-specific studies of preexercise&#xD;and postexercise CHO intake, and the lack of adequate ovarian&#xD;hormonal control within these studies, we are unable to make&#xD;firm conclusions about female-focused recommendations, and&#xD;sex or menstrual phase differences around these themes. </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-13.3pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Although this does not mean that the sports&#xD;nutrition guidelines should not be used by female athletes, it calls&#xD;for new literature to consider any potential adjustments associated&#xD;with special needs or considerations.High-priority areas of research&#xD;have been highlighted throughout this audit that will help to ensure&#xD;that recommendations provided to female athletes regarding CHO&#xD;fueling strategies around training are evidence based.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="10" rect="584.957000,617.668000,768.957000,709.668000"
/></highlight
><text color="#9643FC" creationdate="D:20251014093521+10'00'" flags="print,nozoom,norotate" inreplyto="e1f75960-bb67-44c4-9a98-f474139ae505" date="D:20251014093521+10'00'" name="f8ccb114-f9c7-4b47-bced-a50b5df69267" icon="Comment" page="10" rect="304.103000,686.005000,328.103000,710.005000" subject="Sticky Note" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14b: There was practical reflections on the outcomes of the study</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
